file crates/index/src/parse.rs
symbol highlight
lines 0 59
hash 815db36b08c6bde0
note Runs the grammar's bundled highlight query over the parsed tree and splits every capture into per-line byte spans, a capture over several lines becoming one span per line. Captures can nest and overlap, so each line's spans are sorted by start and a span that starts inside the one before it is dropped: the first one wins, which is the convention those queries are written to.

